{1}{G:}{G:}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Hello.  And who might you be?}{}{5}{me 0, re 41}{23}{}
{3}{Greetings, Maximillian.  Have you a moment?}{}{5}{me 1, re 41}{26}{}
{4}{Sir!  Is that any way for gentlemen to speak to one another?}{}{5}{me 0, re -40}{13}{re +5}
{5}{You're asking for a beating, speaking like that...}{}{5}{me 0, re -40}{17}{re -5}
{6}{Maximillian!  Why the harsh word?}{}{5}{me 1, re -40}{13}{}
