{13}{[He considers you a moment, then inclines his head to you.]  I see you're an individual of class and good breeding.  My assessment of you was wrong, and I'm sorry...}{[He considers you a moment, then inclines his head to you.]  I see you're an individual of class and good breeding.  My assessment of you was wrong, and I'm sorry...}{}{}{}{}
{14}{That's not a problem sir. Might I ask who you are?}{}{5}{me 0}{23}{}
{15}{It's forgotten, Maximillian.  Might I ask you a few questions?}{}{5}{me 1}{26}{}
{17}{Really?  [He steps up to you, his brow furrowing, his fists clenching.]  And who do you propose is going to give me that beating, boy?}{Really?  [He steps up to you, his brow furrowing, his fists clenching.]  And who do you propose is going to give me that beating, woman?}{}{}{}{}
{18}{That would be me, old man.  Prepare yourself...}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 21}
