{172}{I will, Maximillian.  I swear to you...}{}{5}{gf2750 0}{174}{qu1072 2, re +5}
{173}{If I get the chance, I'll look into the matter...}{}{5}{gf2750 0}{174}{qu1072 1}
{174}{I thank you, my friend.  And if he is dead, then forget about me.  I've no desire to return to a Cumbria where men of his kind no longer remain...}{I thank you, my friend.  And if he is dead, then forget about me.  I've no desire to return to a Cumbria where men of his kind no longer remain...}{}{}{}{}
{175}{I see.  Might I ask you a few more questions?}{}{5}{}{26}{lf3 1}
{176}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{lf3 1}
{178}{Yes.  I've still much to tell you.  We'll talk again, later...}{Yes.  I've still much to tell you.  We'll talk again, later...}{}{}{}{}
